In addition to uncursing my bag of holding, I carry around a wand or
two of cancellation so that I can blank potions without having to go
find water and change my shoes, etc.  Saves time and keystrokes.
However, I am super paranoid about my wands and sometimes I'll <esc>
out of 'a'pply 2 or 3 times just to be absolutely certain that I
didn't accidentally hit a key or that I am putting wands of
cancellation in the correct bag.

Wands of cancellation are also useful for taking away the effects of
some annoying monsters.



